       "flexcontaineritem_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Autonomous driving, shared transport, and electric vehicles are all areas of smart mobility solutions where Macnica seeks to make our technology and intelligence available to customers who are addressing the challenges and opportunities around the mobility of people.</p>\n<p>Some prime examples include autonomous driving and shared transport, where we have been working with partners to bring smart mobility solutions to market. We use our knowhow to propose hardware/software integration techniques, to collect the masses of data required from the physical environment, and to build and incorporate AI, cloud platform, and security into smart city technologies and solutions that we develop together with customers and partners.</p>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
