         "text_1": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
          "id": "aptpod",
          "text": "<p><b>aptpod - Bidirectional Data Transmission Platform for Mobility and Industrial IOT -&nbsp;intdash</b></p>\r\n<p>aptpod is an IoT software and services company specializing in high-speed time-series data for industrial IoT applications. They provide a comprehensive suite of technology solutions, including sensor and hardware, cloud computing, and graphical user interface design for IoT/M2M applications. aptpod's platform offers a robust framework for the collecting, transmitting, and processing large volumes of high-speed data in industrial environments, featuring advanced capabilities for real-time processing and event management.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/solutions/smartcity-mobility/aptpod-2.html\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 24 2026 12:34:06 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
         }
