         "text_1": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
          "id": "automotivepro",
          "text": "<p><b>Automotive Pro - Streamlined Remote Data Collection for Automotive Telemetry</b></p>\r\n<p>Introducing Intdash Automotive Pro CAN/CAN-FD DAQ Bundle - a comprehensive automotive telemetry solution supporting CAN/CAN-FD. Our bundled services include specialized in-vehicle equipment, data acquisition interfaces, cloud systems, and intuitive data visualization and management applications.</p>\r\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.macnica.co.jp/en/business/maas/services/144020/\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
