         "text_1": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
          "id": "everfleet",
          "text": "<p><b>everfleet</b></p>\r\n<p>Realizing the social integration of autonomous driving demands a robust system for remote monitoring and control. Our Fleet Management System offers real-time oversight of vehicle positioning and conditions, enabling centralized management across various vehicle types and locations. Maximize operational efficiency with streamlined management and control through a single interface.</p>\r\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.macnica.co.jp/en/business/maas/services/142732/\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 24 2026 12:35:07 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
         }
