        "flexcontaineritem_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
         "text_1": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
          "id": "gama",
          "text": "<p><b>GAMA (formerly NAVYA)</b></p>\r\n<p>GAMA, is at the forefront of autonomous driving solutions. With a mission to alleviate traffic congestion and enhance safety for road users, we're dedicated to the &quot;first and last mile&quot; concept. Our collaboration with France's GAUSSIN led to the establishment of Macnica Mobility, focused on developing autonomous, zero-emission mobility solutions for people and goods transportation.&nbsp;From urban mobility to large tractors and AGVs for private land use, our smart city and mobility solutions pave the way to a more efficient and innovative future.</p>\r\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.macnica.co.jp/en/business/maas/products/133978/\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 24 2026 12:35:32 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
         }
