        "flexcontaineritem_2": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
         "text_1": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
          "id": "icetana",
          "text": "<p><b>icetana</b></p>\r\n<p>Security teams face thousands of cameras and millions of video frames each day, making it easy to miss real threats. icetana transforms existing CCTV systems into proactive security tools by analyzing unusual activity and threats in real time and learning what is normal for each scene within days. Without complex setup, it detects loitering, sudden gatherings, or erratic movement, helping teams focus on credible risks. By filtering routine footage and elevating genuine threats, icetana reduces false alerts, speeds response, and protects people, property, and reputation.</p>\r\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\" href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/ip-software/icetana.html\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 24 2026 12:35:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
         }
